  <data name="Editor.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>MarkdownEditor from the Beresta.Markdown.Wpf.Editor package: the viewer that edits the source of its document. «Blocks» — a click on the drawing puts the caret there, and the blocks under the caret show their source in AvalonEdit; Esc closes them. «Whole text» — the whole source in place of the drawing. «Controls only» — task boxes and folding write into the text. Ctrl+Z and Ctrl+Y undo and redo; the text reaches Markdown a second after the last edit.</value>
