  <data name="TwoPanes.Header" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Two versions of an article, as in a diff: each edit is one figure of line highlights, a connection and an outline; an insertion is green, a deletion red, a change goes from one to the other. Inside lines the removed part is highlighted in red, the added part in green, and an empty piece is marked by a vertical bar. MdScrollSync runs the synchronized scrolling, MdPaneAligner lines the panes up.</value>
